<text x="2" y="78" size="1.8" layer="21" ratio="12">Isolated Line Test Set rev A - 110 x 80 mm, 2 layers. LEFT of the slot is LINE-REFERENCED.</text>
<text x="2" y="66" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">T1 is the only isolation barrier. Keep the slot clear of copper and solder.</text>
<text x="36" y="78" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">SELV: hybrid, TALK 600R / MONITOR 10k, earpiece, electret, headset jack.</text>
<text x="2" y="4" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">Connect only to lines you are authorised to work on. Clipping onto someone else's line is illegal.</text>
